      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 216,
       "endIndex": 243,
       "text": "Google is offering $235,000"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 403,
       "endIndex": 495,
       "text": "Google\u2019s offer sits around **~$552,000/yr** (assuming an annualized $270,000 equity split)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 621,
       "endIndex": 715,
       "text": "**Missing Sign-on Bonus:** Google frequently uses sign-on bonuses ($50k\u2013$100k+) for L6 hires"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 822,
       "endIndex": 930,
       "text": "**The \"Refresher\" math is hypothetical:** While Google's refresher compounding is real over a 4-year horizon"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1073,
       "endIndex": 1213,
       "text": "**Vesting Schedule Nuance:** Note that Google typically front-loads new-hire GSU grants (**38% Year 1, 32% Year 2, 20% Year 3, 10% Year 4**)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1215,
       "endIndex": 1332,
       "text": "If this grant is front-loaded, your Year 1 cash flow would be roughly ~$692k ($235k base + $47k bonus + $410k equity)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1215,
       "endIndex": 1400,
       "text": "If this grant is front-loaded, your Year 1 cash flow would be roughly ~$692k ($235k base + $47k bonus + $410k equity), but your Year 4 equity from this initial grant would drop to $108k"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1719,
       "endIndex": 1794,
       "text": "You have a direct, credible market alternative (staying at Meta for >$520k)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1799,
       "endIndex": 1861,
       "text": "Tech companies expect senior PM candidates (L6/IC6) to counter"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2020,
       "endIndex": 2149,
       "text": "| **Base Salary** | $235,000 | **$255,000 \u2013 $260,000** | Must beat your current $240k base; well within their $271k top-of-band"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2153,
       "endIndex": 2277,
       "text": "| **Equity (4-yr)** | $1,080,000 | **$1,250,000 \u2013 $1,300,000** | Shifts annualized equity from ~$270k to ~$312k\u2013$325k/yr"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2281,
       "endIndex": 2400,
       "text": "| **Sign-On Bonus** | $0 | **$75,000 \u2013 $100,000** | Offsets transition friction and bridges unvested momentum at Meta"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2811,
       "endIndex": 2952,
       "text": "*As you know, I wasn't actively looking and I\u2019m in a great position at Meta making ~$526k, with a $240k base and predictable equity vesting"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3763,
